<title>ITALY: Pisa and Bologna air cargo traffic May 97.</title>
<headline>Pisa and Bologna air cargo traffic May 97.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo traffic at Bologna's airport rose 7.4 percent in May 1997 to 1,229 tonnes against the same period 1996,managing company SAB said.</p>
<p>Pisa airport handled 686 tonnes of cargo traffic in May 1997, up 7.2 percent.</p>
<p>			   May 97	Pct change     Jan-May 97    Pct change</p>
<p>					  against May 96		    vs Jan-May 96</p>
<p>BOLOGNA</p>
<p> Cargo flown		868	up 10.9	   4,057	    up 18.4</p>
<p> via truck		  361    down  0.1	   1,855	   down 9.5</p>
<p> Total traffic	  1,229	up  7.4	   5,912	     up 7.9</p>
<p> Total mail		 264	up  2.9	   1,219	   down 1.5</p>
<p> Total passengers   216,327	up 13.0	 939,325	    up 15.6</p>
<p>PISA</p>
<p> Cargo flown	     357     down 17.7	   1,817	   down 9.6</p>
<p> via truck		 329     up   59.9	   1,490	    up 11.9</p>
<p> Total traffic	   686     up    7.2	   3,307	   down 1.0</p>
<p> Total mail		 85     up   78.8	     380	    up 65.5</p>
<p> Total passengers   94,742     down 23.6	 374,463	   down 7.3</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
